A task box gap keeps a nested description at its content column

```
- [?]  - :: t
         : a
.
<ul class="task-list">
  <li data-task-state="?"><input type="checkbox" disabled> 
    <ul>
      <li>
        <dl>
          <dt>t</dt>
          <dd>a</dd>
        </dl>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- [x]   - :: term
           : desc
           :: next
           : body
.
<ul class="task-list">
  <li data-task-state="x"><input type="checkbox" checked disabled> 
    <ul>
      <li>
        <dl>
          <dt>term</dt>
          <dd>desc</dd>
          <dt>next</dt>
          <dd>body</dd>
        </dl>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```
